      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm grading some high school history essays and I need a hand. One student wrote a piece arguing that \"National identity is a necessary tool for social cohesion and should be prioritized over globalist integration.\" \n\nCan you give me a critique of the logic in that argument?",
