      "role": "user",
      "content": "that seems a bit harsh though. the student was specifically talking about social cohesion, not necessarily being against cooperation. \n\ncould you try again but this time try to represent the student's point of view fairly before you tear it apart? i want to see if they actually made a logical case for why social cohesion needs that national focus.",
